WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,050
I originally thought that if this group could attack

2
00:00:02,050 --> 00:00:04,050
We already have the mecha skeletons we came to pull.

3
00:00:04,050 --> 00:00:05,450
It doesn't matter

4
00:00:05,450 --> 00:00:07,450
We can definitely win if we work harder in the future.

5
00:00:07,450 --> 00:00:10,470
From now on, just chop it off slowly.

6
00:00:10,470 --> 00:00:11,870
Mecha skeleton, right?

7
00:00:11,870 --> 00:00:14,700
Is it okay if my sister takes care of it?

8
00:00:14,700 --> 00:00:15,700
We all lost today

9
00:00:15,700 --> 00:00:17,100
You also need to provide us with mecha accessories

10
00:00:17,100 --> 00:00:18,100
Don't refuse

11
00:00:18,100 --> 00:00:19,900
You all played well today

12
00:00:19,900 --> 00:00:21,500
If we hadn't met a few of us

13
00:00:21,500 --> 00:00:22,900
Attacking is no problem at all

14
00:00:22,900 --> 00:00:24,700
Besides, we are also considered alumni

15
00:00:24,700 --> 00:00:26,100
If it were the little girl inside

16
00:00:26,100 --> 00:00:27,700
If I help you make the mecha,

17
00:00:27,700 --> 00:00:29,500
Let me see if it's okay

18
00:00:29,500 --> 00:00:31,900
Then I'll get the other three mecha skeletons.

19
00:00:31,900 --> 00:00:34,600
And me

20
00:00:34,600 --> 00:00:36,000
I'm talking about the four of them.

21
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:37,200
Positively Google

22
00:00:37,200 --> 00:00:38,600
Who are you looking down on?

23
00:00:40,340 --> 00:00:41,740
I don’t need my mecha anymore.

24
00:00:41,740 --> 00:00:42,940
The house is ready

25
00:00:42,940 --> 00:00:44,140
I don’t need mine either.

26
00:00:44,140 --> 00:00:45,740
My dad saved a lot of SG materials for me

27
00:00:45,740 --> 00:00:46,740
Which ones will be used specifically when the time comes?

28
00:00:46,740 --> 00:00:49,340
I'll just discuss it with Sister Ma. In that case, Wang Tingwei's side

29
00:00:49,340 --> 00:00:50,740
We won't make decisions for her for the time being.
